  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Preguntas en pasiva**",
      "",
      "| Pregunta | Ejemplo |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| *Was / Were + sujeto + participio?* | ***Was** the song **written** by Queen?* |",
      "| *Is / Are + sujeto + participio?* | ***Are** the tickets **sold** online?* |",
      "| *Wh- + was / were + sujeto + participio?* | ***Where was** the film **shot**?* |",
      "| *Who … by?* | ***Who** was it **written by**?* |",
      "",
      "**El agente con by**",
      "",
      "- Se usa *by* si es importante o interesante: *It was written **by Shakespeare**.*",
      "- Se omite si es obvio o desconocido: *The bank was robbed* (no hace falta *by robbers*).",
      "",
      "**Pasiva con modales**",
      "",
      "| Estructura | Ejemplo |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| *modal + be + participio* | *It **can be downloaded**.* · *It **must be finished** today.* |",
      "| *have to + be + participio* | *The forms **have to be signed**.* |",
      "| *going to + be + participio* | *The film **is going to be released** in May.* |",
      "| *present perfect pasiva: have/has been + participio* | *The song **has been covered** by many artists.* |",
      "",
      "**Ojo:** ✘ *The ticket can bought* → ✔ *can **be** bought*. Siempre **be** antes del participio. ✘ *Who did write this book?* se vuelve en pasiva ✔ *Who was this book written by?* (con **by** al final).",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *directed* /dəˈrektɪd/ · *recorded* /rɪˈkɔːdɪd/ · *advance* /ədˈvɑːns/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "It can bought.",
        "right": "It can be bought.",
        "note": "Modal + be + participio."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "Who did this written by?",
        "right": "Who was this written by?",
        "note": "Pasiva: was + participio."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
